\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  1\cf0 .    A glorious light came from the east
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 which directed the wise men.
\par  Shining star of which God has sent
\par to announce, out-door Jesus.
\par Let it also shine for me
\par Let me become a wise man.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  You are my master and my God,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 I will worship and serve you
\par Oh! my master to me strengthen
\par \pard\li270\sl202\slmult0 so I shall be yours truly
\par \pard\sl202\slmult0         Let my possession be thine
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0    and with it to you adore
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.  Glorious light which comes from the east
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0    Oh! wake up everybody
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0      many are still in the darkness
\par     Let them trace their paths to you.
\par     Rise up O, you earth and shine
\par \pard       shine bright for this is your light.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

